{"id":"4abdfa23c470566c","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities.md","title":"快增长与 Hardy 层次的恒等式","display":"thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities — 快增长与 Hardy 层次的恒等式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities","aliases":["72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities"],"display":"thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities — 快增长与 Hardy 层次的恒等式","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]","[[72-lem-hardy-addition-composition]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Thm.2.18; print158–159; PDF170–171","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities — 快增长与 Hardy 层次的恒等式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e620b5020310301\" href=\"?note=8e620b5020310301\" title=\"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"246d4beb5dedc741\" href=\"?note=246d4beb5dedc741\" title=\"72-lem-hardy-addition-composition\">72-lem-hardy-addition-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Thm.2.18; print158–159; PDF170–171"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,F\">\\(B,F\\)</span> 与有限函数迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{[k]}\">\\(f^{[k]}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e620b5020310301\" href=\"?note=8e620b5020310301\" title=\"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow},\\overline k,\\boldsymbol\\omega\">\\(\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow},\\overline k,\\boldsymbol\\omega\\)</span> 及加法复合恒等式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"246d4beb5dedc741\" href=\"?note=246d4beb5dedc741\" title=\"72-lem-hardy-addition-composition\">72-lem-hardy-addition-composition</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_\\alpha(n)=H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\alpha)}(n),\\qquad F_\\alpha(n)=H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\boldsymbol\\omega,\\alpha)}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_\\alpha(n)=H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\alpha)}(n),\\qquad F_\\alpha(n)=H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\boldsymbol\\omega,\\alpha)}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.18，陈述在印刷 p.158 / PDF p.170，证明在印刷 p.159 / PDF p.171。已目视核对指数确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\alpha\">\\(2^\\alpha\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\alpha\">\\(\\omega^\\alpha\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的基本序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>先由加法的树递归归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\\oplus\\delta=\\delta\">\\(\\mathbf0\\oplus\\delta=\\delta\\)</span>。再对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 用乘法递归及 Hardy 加法复合引理得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline k}=H_\\delta^{[k]}\">\\(H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline k}=H_\\delta^{[k]}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时两侧为恒等函数，后继时两侧都再复合一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\delta\">\\(H_\\delta\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>两个结论对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 分别作树归纳。零分支的幂都为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline1\">\\(\\overline1\\)</span>，Hardy 值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\alpha)\">\\(\\delta=\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\alpha)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\mathsf S\\alpha)}=H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline2}=H_\\delta\\circ H_\\delta=B_\\alpha\\circ B_\\alpha=B_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}\">\\(H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\mathsf S\\alpha)}=H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline2}=H_\\delta\\circ H_\\delta=B_\\alpha\\circ B_\\alpha=B_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=\\operatorname{Pow}(\\boldsymbol\\omega,\\alpha)\">\\(\\delta=\\operatorname{Pow}(\\boldsymbol\\omega,\\alpha)\\)</span>；乘法在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\omega\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\omega\\)</span> 处的基本序列给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\delta\\otimes\\boldsymbol\\omega}(n)=H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline{n+1}}(n)=H_\\delta^{[n+1]}(n)=F_\\alpha^{[n+1]}(n)=F_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\">\\(H_{\\delta\\otimes\\boldsymbol\\omega}(n)=H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline{n+1}}(n)=H_\\delta^{[n+1]}(n)=F_\\alpha^{[n+1]}(n)=F_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\)</span>。极限分支的幂和 Hardy、快增长递归都选第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个子树，直接用归纳假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8e620b5020310301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-hardy-addition-composition","status":"resolved","id":"246d4beb5dedc741","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-hardy-addition-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8e620b5020310301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,F$ 与有限函数迭代 $f^{[k]}$ 见 [[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]；$H$、$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow},\\overline k,\\boldsymbol\\omega$ 及加法复合恒等式见 [[72-lem-hardy-addition-composition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-hardy-addition-composition","status":"resolved","id":"246d4beb5dedc741","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,F$ 与有限函数迭代 $f^{[k]}$ 见 [[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]；$H$、$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow},\\overline k,\\boldsymbol\\omega$ 及加法复合恒等式见 [[72-lem-hardy-addition-composition]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B,F","display":false},{"tex":"f^{[k]}","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow},\\overline k,\\boldsymbol\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B_\\alpha(n)=H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\alpha)}(n),\\qquad F_\\alpha(n)=H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\boldsymbol\\omega,\\alpha)}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"2^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0\\oplus\\delta=\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline k}=H_\\delta^{[k]}","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline1","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\operatorname{Pow}(\\overline2,\\mathsf S\\alpha)}=H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline2}=H_\\delta\\circ H_\\delta=B_\\alpha\\circ B_\\alpha=B_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=\\operatorname{Pow}(\\boldsymbol\\omega,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\delta\\otimes\\boldsymbol\\omega}(n)=H_{\\delta\\otimes\\overline{n+1}}(n)=H_\\delta^{[n+1]}(n)=F_\\alpha^{[n+1]}(n)=F_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2349,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities|thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities — 快增长与 Hardy 层次的恒等式]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities — 快增长与 Hardy 层次的恒等式](72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities|thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities — 快增长与 Hardy 层次的恒等式]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-449","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-fast-growing-hardy-identities]]"}],"outgoing":["8e620b5020310301","246d4beb5dedc741"]}